{"version":1,"key":"card:547","content":{"id":547,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在函数执行时，会创建","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"执行上下文","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5fee6692-407c-4040-8a65-b82991aead1a","contentId":1349,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":548,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"，执行上下文中又会创建","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"词法环境","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"08534500-8847-4a87-a4c2-75ef2c57abe0","contentId":1350,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":549,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"，词法环境中存储了当前上下文中定义的变量，当函数执行完成时，执行上下文中的词法环境应当被销毁以释放内存，避免内存泄露，但是如果函数的返回结果是一个函数，并且返回的函数中引用了所处词法环境中的变量，那么此时会阻止词法环境被销毁，使得返回的函数可以继续访问到所处词法环境中的变量。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"015011f1-a27b-4bea-a037-9e6d2460ac4f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"我们认为这个时候就像是形成一个闭合的气泡，把返回的函数和其引用的词法环境包裹在一起，称为闭包。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"631426b9-3694-46a2-9d42-a14bd2a04c91","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function outer() {\n  const a = 1;\n  const b = 2;\n  \n  return function inner() {\n    console.log(a + b);\n  };\n}\n\nconst closure = outer();\nclosure(); // 3","collabId":"b0cc0bf0-fdc8-489d-9524-341a8c9edb1b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"ec4b15a5-a17b-442a-a0f4-d06f641ab455","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"9d7c3af2-9c63-4c02-80a3-851269756e61"},{"children":[{"text":"闭包的底层原理是什么，返回的函数是如何找到其声明处所在作用域的词法环境的呢？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e23f1313-16c0-412c-aed2-3bb5922bf040","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在每个函数中，都有一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[[Environment]]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的内部变量，指向了函数定义时所处的词法环境","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"71c98685-53a1-4d47-a4c4-3dd1858406c6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function outer() {\n  const a = 1;\n  const b = 2;\n  \n  return function inner() {\n    console.log(a + b);\n  };\n}\n\nconst closure = outer();\nconsole.dir(closure);","collabId":"96ae98d3-fc66-462e-abd3-ee93d1107f39","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f0dbdd22-91b5-4188-8fa7-c54b6ae29443","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"1545f225-5ee5-48c4-b070-91afac05e297"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f1ca5901-6227-43fd-a097-89b49604755e","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c5acca0c-0e4a-4966-8479-b5197aa6017f.png"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"对于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[[Environment]]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 变量是规范定义，各浏览器的具体实现不同，上述是 Chrome 浏览器的实现，使用的是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[[Scopes]]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 变量，包含了其作用域链。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"db5bf547-620b-4bf0-ae6e-a43dffffcba2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"ec64cd66-6538-4f52-8084-1fb773c706a7","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"为了防止闭包导致的内存和性能问题，JavaScript 引擎采取了一些优化策略：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"834fa88c-6189-4524-8c04-205edfb1260c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"没有引用任何外部词法环境中的变量，不会形成闭包","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7b780898-5ef8-475e-a36a-bb878affdde2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function outer() {\n  const a = 1;\n  const b = 2;\n  \n  return function inner() {\n    console.log(3);\n  };\n}\n\nconst closure = outer();\nconsole.dir(closure);","collabId":"324ff6b2-a6e5-4923-9eda-294278a17883","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"47628675-5866-4831-b22f-cca5edf02607","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"6c80bcea-d70f-46b0-88dd-650184cffbd5"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"427bee80-39c8-419d-b2b3-177a3029a2a6","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b3f8943c-2e1e-4672-813d-3d8fc315f5e4.png"}],"collabId":"967e128c-8f10-4617-bbbd-87f9d9c557d5","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"只引用了部分变量，那么闭包环境中只会存在引用的变量","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5184e7e5-5d3b-41b6-ae32-8414c64be258","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function outer() {\n  const a = 1;\n  const b = 2;\n  \n  return function inner() {\n    console.log(a);\n  };\n}\n\nconst closure = outer();\nconsole.dir(closure);","collabId":"d0b50e48-c4d5-4cd6-9f94-37c0e083167c","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"03fb81a9-894c-48ff-94f7-36c7bc2578a0","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"00a83b94-f8a1-4045-bffc-3d603cb75833"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b1882792-eecc-49bf-b770-a49d0be84c05","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_68bce9ad-c4e6-4d8d-a3a7-2578d08a46cf.png"}],"collabId":"fca875b5-f4d6-4db1-841d-507a5167bd75","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"73e6f2cc-f86f-4b42-85fb-460a271a446a","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"虽然存在优化策略，但是在不正确引用的情况下可能造成内存泄露，以及对于复杂的情况还是需要手动进行内存管理引用","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eb1dadde-820c-481d-a424-b63e853ae78a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 只引用了 data.length，但是整个 data 都会被放到闭包中，长期持有将造成内存泄露\n// 应当将 length 的声明放在外面，只引用 length 就行\nfunction outer() {\n  const data = new Array(100000).fill(0)\n  // const length = data.length;\n  return function inner() {\n    const length = data.length;\n    console.log(length);\n  };\n}\n\nconst closure = outer();\nconsole.dir(closure);","collabId":"ee927ba5-bad2-4422-a434-74613a87fe14","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"56225b1c-672c-461c-8d3d-427bd1e9f35a","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"27173550-f77b-4f1e-a205-d1b0ceeec7d5"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a28c4ad1-b63b-4c13-b924-a69e71a81cd7","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_04015c85-e00d-4767-9c3f-f0d5f9690ec2.png"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 动态引用了数据，无法进行优化，这个时候会将所有的词法环境的所有变量都放入闭包\nfunction outer() {\n  const data = new Array(100000).fill(0)\n  const length = data.length;\n  return function inner() {\n    console.log(eval(\"console.log(length)\"));\n  };\n}\n\nconst closure = outer();\nconsole.dir(closure);","collabId":"922db81a-7d83-4e55-b913-ec1bfade4b84","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"bf58ac64-1aa1-49c9-a153-da8b4bdc02a4","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f58255ed-14c9-4ede-bbd4-bf756d866e03"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a6fb28ab-1493-4430-8749-662aeea4703a","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f55c9193-fa7f-48f4-94ef-31bd02fa32c7.png"}],"tags":["JavaScript/闭包","JavaScript/底层原理"],"createTime":1743680556519,"updateTime":1793532556208,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532556208},"links":{"card:548":{"key":"card:548","type":"card","id":548},"card:549":{"key":"card:549","type":"card","id":549}}}